\title{zugojson: JSON Formatting with a Parser Written in 'Goose'}
\description{
Formats, minifies and validates 'JSON' text with a parser and printer written in the 'Goose' programming language (\url{https://github.com/aardappel/goose}) and compiled ahead of time to C, which the package bundles. 'Goose' is a memory-safe systems language with no heap: the parsed document lives in one contiguous block linked by 4-byte relative offsets. The package replaces the 'Goose' runtime with a small one that reports every runtime failure as an R error instead of ending the process. No 'Goose' compiler is needed to install the package.
}
